  "description": "As a timid high schooler, Chi-Yeong works up the courage to confess to his crush, Eui-Geon, knowing he already likes his friend, Joon-Yeong. Over 10 years after Chi-Yeong is rejected, Eui-Geon shows up at Chi-Yeong's shop with Joon-Yeong, who he still clearly has one-sided feelings for. Not only that, but Eui-Geon doesn't even recognize Chi-Yeong from their high school days. Even so, Chi-Yeong can't help the love that starts growing inside him again. Are both he and Eui-Geon forever doomed to an unrequited love, or could this unexpected reunion be the start of something new?\n\n(Source: Tappytoon)",
